 The ProjectAchilles root CA is name-constrained: it can only ever issue
 certificates for names in this zone and its subdomains. The zone can't be
 widened later without re-issuing the root and re-distributing it to every
 endpoint, so pick the narrowest zone that covers achilles.corp.example.com.
 
